    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Retinoblastoma ",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Moderately differentiated retinoblastoma with predominant Flexner&ndash;Wintersteiner rosettes (with an empty centre) and a few Homer Wright rosettes (centre filled by cytoplasmic tangles).",
